  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given sets is:\n\n**Second term - First term = 11 **\n\n**Third term - Second term = 13**\n\nNow, we apply the pattern to the given sets:\n\n(14, 25, 38)\n\n__**25 - 14**__ = 11 __**38 - 25**__ = 13\n\n11 = 11 13 = 13\n\n(8, 19, 32)\n\n__19 - 8__ = 11 __32 - 19__ = 13\n\n11 = 11 13 = 13\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (24, 35, 46)\n\n__35 - 24__ = 11 __46 - 35__ = 13\n\n11 = 11 11 ≠ 13\n\nOption 2) (6, 17, 30)\n\n__17 - 6__ = 11 __30 - 17__ = 13\n\n11 = 11 13 = 13\n\nOption 3) (15, 28, 41)\n\n__28 - 15__ = 11 __**41**____ - 28__ = 13\n\n13 ≠ 11 13 = 13\n\nOption 4) (13, 26, 37)\n\n__26 - 13__ = 11 __37 - 26__ = 13\n\n13 ≠ 11 11 ≠ 13\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 2).**",
